        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we use third-party catastrophe exposure models and an internally developed analysis to assess each risk to ensure we include an appropriate charge for assumed catastrophe risks.",
